Interesting visual bug in Sable Next AppImage on Linux: 
some messages are displayed with only one letter per line. Especially emoticons like ":3c". See Erwan's message in the attached screenshot.

Adding the following css code fixes it but it's probably a bad fix x3

```
.has-receipts {
  width: 100%;
}
```
